WEBVTT

00:05:29.216 --> 00:05:31.608
Look, you don't live in a wealthy country.

00:05:31.632 --> 00:05:33.679
I mean -- this is Iraq.

00:05:35.275 --> 00:05:37.188
This is what you see.

00:05:37.212 --> 00:05:39.526
You see people struggling to get by.

00:05:39.873 --> 00:05:41.942
It's not easy; you see a lot of poverty.

00:05:41.966 --> 00:05:43.633
And you feel something about this.

00:05:43.657 --> 00:05:45.754
These people have designs
for your resource,

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:47.083
and this is what you see?

00:05:47.982 --> 00:05:50.094
Something else you see
that you talk about --

00:05:50.118 --> 00:05:52.328
Americans don't talk
about this, but you do --

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:54.879
there's this thing,
this militarization of the world,

00:05:54.903 --> 00:05:57.047
and it's centered
right in the United States.

00:05:57.071 --> 00:05:58.945
And the United States is responsible

00:05:58.969 --> 00:06:03.447
for almost one half
of the world's military spending.